      "message": "[error] Line 186: 🔴 `generateSdesOfferAttributes()` always tries to emit `AES_256_CM_HMAC_SHA1_80` first, but `generateSdesAttribute()` now throws if the suite is absent from `CryptoSuites`. On builds where AES-256 SDES is not available, call setup will fail instead of falling back to AES-128. Build the offer list dynamically from `CryptoSuites` (prefer AES-256 when present, then AES-128), or skip unsupported suites instead of throwing in the offer-construction path.",
