      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 629: 🟡 The new answer-side loop pairs local and remote media by compacted index (`localSession_-\u003emedia[i]` with `remoteSession_-\u003emedia[i]`). Because local media are appended only when `media.enabled_` is true, index alignment can drift when some remote sections are disabled/rejected, causing crypto negotiation to be applied to the wrong m-line or skipped. Track the original remote m-line index when creating local media, or negotiate SDES at media-creation time using the corresponding remote media object.",
      "revId": "8992bf0e1849380242e79b4eaf90fd5c4fa66913",
